peak early it's good it it it  stimulates you it even helps in  developing comprehension but it needn't  be accurate it needs to be correct you  didn't have to worry about grammar or  anything else you want to get that  comprehension in  comprehension is kind of like the  fertilizer there's all these leaves that  are falling in there that are  decomposing and becoming fertilizer so  that at a later stage your garden can  leap and you can leap forward and of  course as i always say eventually you  have to do a lot of speaking but it has  to be based on this firm this rich soil  of comprehension of words and so forth  so in language learning  the first year  it sleeps  like a garden the second year it creeps  and the third year it leaps now that  needn't be three years it can be six  months six months six months or three  months three months three months  depending on  how different the language is from  languages you already speak  thank you for listening bye for now  [Music]  you
 

